[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]史实 vs 演义[/font][/b]


《三国演义》对邹靖的改写主要体现在：


[indent]1.  [color=#000000]职务虚构[/color]：演义中邹靖是[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "刘焉", "cat": "people"}]刘焉[/url][/color]（[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "幽州", "cat": "geography"}]幽州[/url][/color]太守/牧）的部下校尉；实际上正史无载邹靖隶属刘焉，刘焉主要任益州牧。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]2.  [color=#000000]引荐关系[/color]：演义中邹靖引荐刘、关、张见刘焉；正史只记录刘备"从校尉邹靖讨黄巾"，并无引荐刘焉的情节。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]3.  [color=#000000][color=#0066FF][url={"research": "程远志", "cat": "people"}]程远志[/url][/color]之战[/color]：演义中邹靖领刘备破程远志五万大军；正史中程远志、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "邓茂", "cat": "people"}]邓茂[/url][/color]均为虚构人物，"五万"更是文学夸张。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]4.  [color=#000000]解青州围[/color]：演义中邹靖奉命领兵五千赴援青州太守龚景；正史中龚景和此次援救均无对应记载。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[color=#000000]史实与演义的共通之处：[/color]

[indent]•  邹靖确实参与了黄巾之役[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  邹靖与刘备有真实的军事合作关系[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  邹靖活动范围涉及幽冀一带（符合正史）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


